  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.3.5\n      - Filters redesigned as pills: click a filter to edit it, click away to close it. Filter settings are switches at the top of the Filters panel.\n      - Filter groups with an And / Or switch. Filters on the report page are pills that rerun the report when they close.\n      - Slicers: a date slicer and a grouping slicer put quick buttons on the report.\n      - Outer groups: Nested Tables layout, page break per group, editable group heading styles and a Label - Value option.\n      - Table formatting on the report: header style popup, row alignment, borders, alternate rows and page color. Hide Report Name option.\n      - Column header menu for alignment, grouping and outer groups, and a compact Field Options dialog.\n      - Lookup filters: Select all for in / not in, and full field names on hover.\n      - Charts: Show Dates with No Data fills missing dates with zero.\n      - Multi-condition joins in Setup > Relations and Configure Joins, and Import from Database reads foreign keys.\n      - Excel and Word exports and scheduled emails keep outer group layouts, heading styles and table formatting.\n      - Word exports of outer-group reports end with a report total, with a subtotal per group when that option is on.\n      - Clicking the header of a Month/Year column sorts it by date instead of by month name.\n      - Choose Column Label is used in Excel, PDF, Word and CSV exports.\n      - Fixes: custom date formats on Month/Year groups, Group by Year showing a date, removing an outer group, cascading filters, copying a custom field.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "6.3.5",
